<title>USA: Allen Cty USD 256, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Allen Cty USD 256, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank, Kansas City said it won $2.250 million of Allen Cty (Marmaton Valley) USD 256, Kan., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.39 percent.</p>
</text>
